  "registration": {
    "subject": "__CODE__ 是你的 Codex Switch 注册验证码",
    "text": "注册验证\n\n你正在创建新的 Codex Switch 账户。为验证邮箱，请输入下方验证码：\n\n__CODE__\n\n用途：注册 Codex Switch\n时间：__REQUESTED_AT__\n有效期：5 分钟\n\n请勿将验证码提供给他人。\n若你未尝试注册，可安全忽略此邮件。",
    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light only\">\n  <title>__CODE__ 是你的 Codex Switch 注册验证码</title>\n  <style>\n    @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {\n      .email-shell { width: 100% !important; }\n      .email-content { padding-left: 28px !important; padding-right: 28px !important; }\n      .code-box { font-size: 38px !important; letter-spacing: 9px !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#252529;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;\">\n    注册验证，验证码 __CODE__，5 分钟内有效。\n  </div>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0;\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"620\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" class=\"email-shell\" style=\"width:620px;max-width:620px;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:64px 24px 62px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:separate;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td width=\"58\" height=\"58\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" aria-label=\"Codex Switch\" style=\"width:58px;height:58px;border:3px solid #252529;border-radius:50%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:58px;color:#252529;\">⇄</td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"email-content\" style=\"padding:0 48px 64px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;\">\n              <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 30px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;color:#18181b;\">注册验证</h1>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 32px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.75;color:#49494f;\">你正在创建新的 Codex Switch 账户。为验证邮箱，请输入下方验证码：</p>\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"center\" class=\"code-box\" style=\"padding:25px 12px;background:#f5f6f7;border-radius:10px;font-family:'SFMono-Regular',Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:42px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:12px;color:#19191d;white-space:nowrap;\">__CODE__</td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:36px;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td width=\"76\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#55555b;white-space:nowrap;\">用途：</td>\n                  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:600;color:#3f3f45;\">注册 Codex Switch</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td width=\"76\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#55555b;white-space:nowrap;\">时间：</td>\n                  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:600;color:#3f3f45;\">__REQUESTED_AT__</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td width=\"76\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#55555b;white-space:nowrap;\">有效期：</td>\n                  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:600;color:#3f3f45;\">5 分钟</td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n              <p style=\"margin:34px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#49494f;\">请勿将验证码提供给他人。<br>若你未尝试注册，可安全忽略此邮件。</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"border-top:1px solid #eeeeef;padding:24px 28px 32px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#99999f;\">\n              Codex Switch · 此邮件由系统自动发送，请勿直接回复\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>"
  },
  "password-reset": {
    "subject": "__CODE__ 是你的 Codex Switch 密码重置验证码",
    "text": "重置密码\n\n你刚刚请求重置 Codex Switch 账户密码。为进行安全验证，请输入下方验证码：\n\n__CODE__\n\n用途：重置账户密码\n时间：__REQUESTED_AT__\n有效期：5 分钟\n\n请勿将验证码提供给他人。\n若你未尝试重置密码，可安全忽略此邮件。",
    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light only\">\n  <title>__CODE__ 是你的 Codex Switch 密码重置验证码</title>\n  <style>\n    @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {\n      .email-shell { width: 100% !important; }\n      .email-content { padding-left: 28px !important; padding-right: 28px !important; }\n      .code-box { font-size: 38px !important; letter-spacing: 9px !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#252529;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;\">\n    重置密码，验证码 __CODE__，5 分钟内有效。\n  </div>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0;\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"620\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" class=\"email-shell\" style=\"width:620px;max-width:620px;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:64px 24px 62px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:separate;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td width=\"58\" height=\"58\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" aria-label=\"Codex Switch\" style=\"width:58px;height:58px;border:3px solid #252529;border-radius:50%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:58px;color:#252529;\">⇄</td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"email-content\" style=\"padding:0 48px 64px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;\">\n              <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 30px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;color:#18181b;\">重置密码</h1>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 32px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.75;color:#49494f;\">你刚刚请求重置 Codex Switch 账户密码。为进行安全验证，请输入下方验证码：</p>\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"center\" class=\"code-box\" style=\"padding:25px 12px;background:#f5f6f7;border-radius:10px;font-family:'SFMono-Regular',Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:42px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:12px;color:#19191d;white-space:nowrap;\">__CODE__</td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:36px;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td width=\"76\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#55555b;white-space:nowrap;\">用途：</td>\n                  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:600;color:#3f3f45;\">重置账户密码</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td width=\"76\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#55555b;white-space:nowrap;\">时间：</td>\n                  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:600;color:#3f3f45;\">__REQUESTED_AT__</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td width=\"76\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#55555b;white-space:nowrap;\">有效期：</td>\n                  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:600;color:#3f3f45;\">5 分钟</td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n              <p style=\"margin:34px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#49494f;\">请勿将验证码提供给他人。<br>若你未尝试重置密码，可安全忽略此邮件。</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"border-top:1px solid #eeeeef;padding:24px 28px 32px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#99999f;\">\n              Codex Switch · 此邮件由系统自动发送，请勿直接回复\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>"
